### 4. **Query Running on Wrong Thread / Caching**
```kotlin
// ❌ Querying on main thread with a stale/cached result
val count = db.myDao().getCount() // might return cached value

// ✅ Force fresh query on IO dispatcher
lifecycleScope.launch {
    val count = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        db.myDao().getCount()
    }
    displayCount(count)
}
```

